    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-4448",
      "problem": "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/ae28fa897a3fbffac0732fb7db3ccd6ecee17427821329603a4a8429b439d14f.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/2645bb2511a10c7ce073895d672533161c79ac28f805f31d6c151b89af4b3e99.svg)\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/aec59387ac665f8a0eb1b0b51f9a1e662c5d4c754ea432d16c1c6b065c1d02b9.svg)\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{23} & =(-1)^{2+3}{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
